  "title": "Flutterwave Expands African Footprint with Payment Systems License in Uganda",
  "summary": "Kampala, Uganda – August 28, 2024: Flutterwave, a leading payments technology company, has received a Payment Systems Operator (PSO) license from the Bank of Uganda. This marks a key milestone in Flutterwave’s expansion across Africa, adding Uganda to its growing list of countries where it operates. Uganda’s digital payment landscape is transforming, driven by a […]",
